[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13803.03, "timestamp": "03:50:03", "text": "愉快的音乐。 而"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13805.83, "timestamp": "03:50:05", "text": "现在，你很明显地感觉到了，我正在用明显的方式来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13808.87, "timestamp": "03:50:08", "text": "表达，而不是用“融化”这个词。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13813.59, "timestamp": "03:50:13", "text": "呃，我一开始本应该用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13816.71, "timestamp": "03:50:16", "text": "melt 来流式传输，但这并不明显。 我用“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13819.429, "timestamp": "03:50:19", "text": "显而易见”这个词，是因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13824.309, "timestamp": "03:50:24", "text": "我的电脑配置很简单，没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13827.269, "timestamp": "03:50:27", "text": "太多花哨的东西，但我仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13830.79, "timestamp": "03:50:30", "text": "无法流畅地进行直播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13835.429, "timestamp": "03:50:35", "text": "我的意思是，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13838.79, "timestamp": "03:50:38", "text": "笔记本电脑。 哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13841.91, "timestamp": "03:50:41", "text": "所以，我真的很想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13846.309, "timestamp": "03:50:46", "text": "升级内存，但是要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13853.67, "timestamp": "03:50:53", "text": "560000到60000日元。 这太离谱了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13857.59, "timestamp": "03:50:57", "text": "我笔记本电脑上用的也是同样的内存条。"}]